<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110642" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῆμις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, ἡ, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήμη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speech, talk,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				10.207
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς θῶκον πρόμολον δήμοιό τε
				φῆμιν</span> the <i>place of talk</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.468
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>common opinion</i> or <i>judgement expressed in talk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλεπὴ δ᾽ ἔχε δήμου φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.239
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.75
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀλεείνω φῆμιν
			ἀδευκέα</span> their 'bitter <i>gossip</i>', <i><span class="en">
				6.273
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κασσάνδραν . . φᾶμις ἔχησι βροτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ibyc.
					9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. ἀοιδῶν</span> their <i>praise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Euph.
				40
			</span></i>: hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>reputation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλεπὴν δέ τε φῆμιν ὀπάσσει . .
					γυναιξί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.201
				</span></i>
			; later of <i>good report,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Man.
				3.183
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				237
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
